worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}0\\cdot 5+11\\cdot (-1) \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ (-3)\\cdot 5+2\\cdot (-1)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299699 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "870297b1-7500-5a20-a6b1-e81b43473cf9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298137}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "870297b1-7500-5a20-a6b1-e81b43473cf9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298137} :answer-field/id #uuid "32699cda-5915-5f3d-b0c7-b5c0647e0284" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298810} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7de0f2e8-64ff-5886-8923-da8a8b127afd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-34" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298098}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7de0f2e8-64ff-5886-8923-da8a8b127afd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-34" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298098} :answer-field/id #uuid "6d7fa884-da30-56a5-8320-6176e7495b0c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299003}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "a0f60